    {
      "id": "71a19cfe-5457-452e-962d-37706e330c9c",
      "title": "Escute a sequência e observe como a atualização anda em partes curtas.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 1,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "e4ca83cb-e417-4c71-b06e-8229cbc3943b",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute a primeira parte do modelo.</p><p><strong>Hoy estoy de mejor humor porque dormí bien.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Hoje estou de melhor humor porque dormi bem.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/3574215c12a94efca1a0bceea2ebda67_l05b01-hoy-estoy-de-mejor-humor-porque-dormi-bien.mp3?Expires=1794099584&Signature=VLh~VaxAfC0LjWMfGanEwBihTUAMJ~x0dY52BbI7~l0I4tQk6P4dEB60O3cK2C2i5fWzTJ~JX3Lx17WZehqVr8dvOPyfb-mTd6eo9cqmKIB1h7Z1CkOJwGeJf4TAEzHlLapvxePd3tegW5L4wkgkJ0dSWPOeNnW51y4aGJ1L-eidVCUMiJAfYQR6L1WOXe-xkS19DGWAL9vCARDyTyHpRckxjF9OFIvYtOgNC4KFFzQ8KAhF4C99GVFiNmLoiLoMk3xlomjZsZTfPuXNzayag3QO9JGxtLvK-PQ5LDy1HJp4vzP1YFUCm4ocGjEoLDmFy4Uyvq18lVW2zTiXFIHtXQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "0faea020-120c-4a92-8ea8-c5c9e9d9aad1",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora escute a reação curta.</p><p><strong>¡Qué bien!</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Que bom!</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/3f40bb551f0144b9adef5e91ec73f9c7_l05b04-que-bien.mp3?Expires=1794099584&Signature=Hyi5mUnpgTDc15aPkrKXm39oNF0Qj9tP5BfZViD4wjqnzwr6X8zj2mk9BNWpcrFi6uM8YPKDUBFBarTnDu8yEAAIvuXFFC7Mabr1q5QU0tTDWj7CmwwlU1oFmsQW7uBJ5WKDuG-CRpT4CwgzY-DxYxD6EuTLyFF18z35NdBxLMOEqFB4JFdN9OEh6VxFicnInO~R-s9wRlv0jAAcKNVK2Jb-47~HBz6VFtTzywrlXb8qzO93InC0hU0RlnCmACKQnNDcOTquu6LDftUnnOBhzJWA4y1ZKey4EPtllEH69pO5F562uRB2fjM7xwBIrzUz3QCCrHECqkAQRt-I2WyMEA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "04ece426-f6eb-4476-a822-3620bf25b3e2",
          "textContent": "<p>Feche a sequência com a resposta de apoio.</p><p><strong>Me alegro por ti.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Fico feliz por você.</strong></p>",
